msgid ""
"Switching entitlement types after being reviewed is not supported. Please "
"reach out to your project coordinator for additional help if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Kubadilisha aina za haki baada ya kukaguliwa hakutumiki. Tafadhali wasiliana"
" na mratibu wa mradi wako kwa usaidizi wa ziada ikiwa ni lazima."

