#: apps/course_metadata/models.py:2298
msgid ""
"Title specific for this run of a course. Leave this value blank to default "
"to the parent course's title."
msgstr ""
"Kichwa mahususi cha uendeshaji huu wa kozi. Acha thamani hii iwe "
"chaguomsingi kwa mada ya kozi kuu."

#: apps/course_metadata/models.py:2307
msgid ""
"Short description specific for this run of a course. Leave this value blank "
"to default to the parent course's short_description attribute."
msgstr ""
"Maelezo mafupi mahususi kwa uendeshaji huu wa kozi. Acha thamani hii iwe "
"chaguomsingi kwa sifa fupi ya maelezo mafupi ya kozi kuu."

#: apps/course_metadata/models.py:2311
msgid ""
"Full description specific for this run of a course. Leave this value blank "
"to default to the parent course's full_description attribute."
msgstr ""
"Maelezo kamili mahususi kwa uendeshaji huu wa kozi. Acha thamani hii iwe "
"chaguomsingi kwa sifa ya maelezo kamili ya kozi kuu."

#: apps/course_metadata/models.py:2316
msgid ""
"Estimated minimum number of hours per week needed to complete a course run."
msgstr ""
"Kadirio la idadi ya chini ya saa zinazohitajika kwa wiki ili kukamilisha "
"mwendo wa kozi."

#: apps/course_metadata/models.py:2319
msgid ""
"Estimated maximum number of hours per week needed to complete a course run."
msgstr ""
"Kadirio la idadi ya juu zaidi ya saa zinazohitajika kwa wiki ili kukamilisha"
" mwendo wa kozi."
